  "id": "DOC-19-T419db",
  "title": "Text: DET Doug Teter ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2019-04-26",
  "from": "DET Doug Teter",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "2:15 AM",
      "text": "Hey, I’m checking in with you tomorrow morning about Zimm. I hope it’s not serious, but you know what I have going on right now"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "2:16 AM",
      "text": "If it is serious, and this is something that is newsworthy...this is the top beat writing job in baseball and it would change my life"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "2:16 AM",
      "text": "I’m not playing that card again"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "2:19 AM",
      "text": "Anthony I’m not going to know exactly what the situation is till I get the MRI back tomorrow afternoon."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "2:20 AM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "2:21 AM",
      "text": "I’ll check in tomorrow. Thanks for getting back to me. Again ... I’m not playing this card again, but it is what it is. This is big."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:22 PM",
      "text": "Just checking in"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "1:23 PM",
      "text": "No word.  Getting tests"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:24 PM",
      "text": "Ok, I don’t wanna bug you all afternoon, when should I try you again"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "1:25 PM",
      "text": "When I know something I’ll call Al and let you know to call him"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:25 PM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "3:56 PM",
      "text": "Al has the info and we are releasing a press note at 3.  Just call and ask if there is any news on zimm"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:58 PM",
      "text": "No answer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:58 PM",
      "text": "How vague could I be with it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:58 PM",
      "text": "Is it good news"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "3:58 PM",
      "text": "Somewhat"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:59 PM",
      "text": "Ok so not like elbow surgery"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:59 PM",
      "text": "Just tell me damnit"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:59 PM",
      "text": "Or call me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:59 PM",
      "text": "That’s easier"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "3:59 PM",
      "text": "No on surgery"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:00 PM",
      "text": "IL, though"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "4:02 PM",
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:02 PM",
      "text": "They announced it. What’s timetable"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:06 PM",
      "text": "Or here....what’s the grade. Way off the record"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:06 PM",
      "text": "I can ask my sports doctor buddy"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:06 PM",
      "text": "Won’t put the grade out there, just timeline"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Doug Teter",
      "time": "4:07 PM",
      "text": "Talking with zimm now.  Will call in a few"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "4:07 PM",
      "text": "Ty"
    }
  ]
}